From 32515634f13a2206efa8629a4b1bcbeeeec8bd14 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Hya <hyacinthe@Mac-mini-de-Hya.local>
Date: Wed, 10 Jun 2026 13:25:44 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] feat: mobile sessions swipe drawer with full-screen panel

- Sessions panel full-screen on mobile with parallax content sweep
- Chat card slides right on open, stays in place on close
- Swipe-to-close from chat card area
- Left edge swipe to open drawer
- Scroll lock during transitions (body fixed + overflow hidden)
- Android back gesture margin (20px)
- Will-change hints for 120fps animations
- Desktop surface: ?surface=desktop query param
